      <h2>2. Hosting via Cloudflare Pages</h2>
      <p>This website is hosted via Cloudflare Pages (Cloudflare, Inc.). When the site is accessed, Cloudflare automatically processes technical data such as the IP address in server log files, among other things to deliver the page and protect against abuse. Details: <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>3. Contact form</h2>
      <p>The contact form is processed via the third-party service Web3Forms. The data entered (name, email, message) is transmitted to Web3Forms and forwarded from there by email; on the free plan, submissions are stored there for up to 30 days. The legal basis is Art. 6 (1)(b) GDPR (processing a request). Details: <a href="https://web3forms.com/" class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">web3forms.com</a> (check their footer for the current privacy policy link).</p>

      <h2>4. Google Fonts</h2>
      <p>This site loads the "Fraunces" and "Work Sans" typefaces via Google Fonts; the font files are loaded from Google's servers when the page is opened, which can transmit the visitor's IP address to Google. <strong>Note:</strong> for a site aimed mainly at German visitors, it is more privacy-friendly to self-host Google Fonts instead, to avoid this data transfer. <span class="placeholder">[Remove this section once switched to self-hosted fonts.]</span></p>

      <h2>5. Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
      <p>This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics for anonymous traffic measurement. This service works without cookies and without recognising individual visitors across page views; only aggregated, non-personal usage statistics are collected. Details: <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>. Beyond this, the site does not use marketing cookies.</p>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to access, rectify, erase or restrict the processing of your personal data, as well as a right to object to processing and a right to data portability. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority.</p>

      <h2>7. SSL/TLS encryption</h2>
      <p>For security reasons, this site uses SSL/TLS encryption (visible by "https://" in the address bar), provided by Cloudflare Pages by default.</p>
